      "title": "Tanfac Industries Limited Announces Board Appointments, Effective January 09, 2026",
      "body": "Tanfac Industries Limited announced that at its Extra-Ordinary General Meeting held on February 23, 2026 approval of change in designation of Mr. Afzal Harunbhai Malkani from Non-Executive Non-Independent Director to Managing Director. Appointment of Mrs. Sandhya Venugopal Sharma as a Director (Category: Nominee Director, Non-executive). Mr. Afzal Harunbhai Malkani, Date of appointment: January 09, 2026 (Liable to retire by rotation) and the other terms and conditions as set out in the appointment letter. Mr. Afzal Harunbhai Malkani is a Chartered Accountant with more than 25 years of experience in finance, accounts, corporate finance, capital markets, fund raising, mergers and acquisitions, and regulatory compliances. He was associated with Anupam Rasayan India Limited for about 17 years,",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
