      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹15.61 (vs ₹34.89 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹15.61 (down from ₹34.89 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.73b (down 2.7% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹155.7m (down 55% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.0% (down from 20% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 20% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 51% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
